Package: a3-engine-bench
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: a3-core, pipewire-jack
Description: A3 engine bench: four channel strips on JACK, for parity runs against REAPER
 A headless JACK host for the four A3 channel strips. It reads the OSC
 address truth from /usr/share/a3/a3-osc.json (installed by a3-core, or
 pass --truth FILE) and is meant for parity and load runs next to REAPER.
